    "features": "<p><em>Assistant Mechanic of the Rocinante, Earther</em></p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Cover Your Tracks, Lightning Attack, Momentum, Vicious Blow</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Fringer (Novice), Improvisation (Expert), Intrigue (Novice), Maker (Expert), Misdirection (Novice)</p><p><strong>Augmentations:</strong> By taking an Activate action to trigger her augmentations, Clarissa gains the following benefits: • Her Speed doubles and she gains +2 Defense. • She can perform the Stunt Attack action as a minor action on her turn. • She gains the benefits of the Brawling focus and the Master degrees of the Overwhelm Style and Striking Style talents. • She can spend SP as a force multiplier on Strength (Might) tests: x2 for 2 SP, x5 for 4 SP. • She can perform the Lightning Attack and Momentum stunts for −1 SP each. After five rounds, Clarissa is Helpless for 5+1d6 minutes and has to succeed on a TN 15 Willpower test to take any actions during that time.</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> Hand terminal</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 1/3 (Armor)</p>",
